    BstLean.Part241.biasRoot 12508 chi biasFloor epsilon varianceMax
      energyError locationError locationNorm varianceNorm + 1 / 10 ^ 8 + 1 / 10 ^ 20 ≤
        BstLean.Part266.agent12508.root

